This archive contains the source code to Tim Kientzle's XY, Z and Kprograms.  I have successfully compiled them using Ultra C 1.3.  TheMakefile.ucc is included for this.  There is also a Makefile.gcc whichI have not tried.The compiled versions in CMDS have been compiled with Ultra C 1.3.Therefore, you will need the 'fpu' module installed in your system.See fpu.doc for instructions on how to do this.Enjoy!Boisy